---
// Hero photograph slot. Used in the homepage hero next to the headline.
// Real Unsplash photo replacing the earlier SVG illustration.
// To swap to a different photo, drop a 1600x900-ish JPG into /public/images/hero/
// and update the src below.
//
// Photo: Unsplash, Solar engineer at panel array, golden-hour light.
// Source: https://unsplash.com/photos/2e959784a276
// Used under the Unsplash License (no attribution required, but the source URL
// is preserved here for provenance).
---
<div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-card shadow-xl ring-1 ring-black/5">
  <img
    src="/images/hero/hero-solar-engineer.jpg"
    alt="An engineer working alongside an array of rooftop solar panels in warm afternoon light, illustrating the kind of EPRA-licensed installation Precifarm delivers."
    width="1600"
    height="1067"
    loading="eager"
    decoding="async"
    fetchpriority="high"
    class="w-full h-full object-cover aspect-[4/3]"
  />
  <!-- Subtle navy gradient overlay at the bottom for legibility if text ever overlays it -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-1/3 bg-gradient-to-t from-navy-dark/30 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
</div>
